photo/video team is located strategically around the Northwest. We serve all of Oregon and Washington, with camera operators in Portland,&nbsp;Eugene, Bend, Seattle, Olympia, and Southern&nbsp;Oregon.","tn2ed90868":"Meet Daniel","tn18b8d606":"Founder, Creative Director","t4b2fc60":"Refer"},"textarea":{"tan3f223dea":"A Beautiful Union is a wedding <span class=\"text-span-6\">photo + video studio</span> headquartered in lovely <span class=\"text-span-7\">Eugene, Oregon.</span>","tan7404a1a3":"Founder/<br>Creative Director","ta1d067833":"Producer/<br>Coordinator","tan54f0b170":"I picked up a camera to shoot a friend's wedding in 2014, and I never set it back down. Over the last decade, I’ve assembled an amazing photo/video team.<br><br>We're here to tell incredible stories and to support our fellow wedding vendors. This is truly a community I love."},"richtext":{},"iframe":{}}